Z||000000||snowkttn||10-06-2000||04:23 PM||||Well guys!  You would be proud of this girl today!  As I was driving to work, this 2000 Dodge Dakota V8 pulled up next to me at the lights, his lane was ending and merging into my lane in the next two blocks.  As he peered over at me with his buddy and laughed, the light turned green, he stepped on it....well you can imagine, I was not going to let this go, so I stepped on it too!!  And yes....I blew his doors off hehehehehe....so much for him thinking his truck had power hehehehehehehe....needless to say, my ride to work after that was fantastic.....as I smiled the rest of the way!!!!!  I love my Fiero!!!!!!||||reg||6
